+      "Combat statistics": "Initiative +3. AC 15 (−1 size, +3 Dexterity, +3 natural armor), touch 12, flat-footed 12. Base attack +3, grapple +12. Space 10 ft., reach 5 ft.",
+      "Attack": "Claw. Melee +7, 1d4 + 5 damage.",
